# Builds for auth-broker-tee no longer go through Cloud Build.
# The build pipeline is now [.github/workflows/build-and-attest.yml](.github/workflows/build-and-attest.yml),
# which runs on GitHub Actions, signs each image keyless via Sigstore,
# and publishes an in-toto compliance attestation to Rekor.
#
# Why the move: Cloud Build's signing identity is a GCP service account
# under the project owner's control, which weakens the supply-chain
# trust property. GitHub Actions OIDC issues an identity tied to the
# specific workflow file on the specific branch, which the operator
# cannot re-issue without a public commit and a new Sigstore Rekor
# entry. See SUPPLY_CHAIN_BOOTSTRAP.md.
#
# If you reach this file via muscle memory: stop running `gcloud builds
# submit`, push to master on https://github.com/FemLed/auth-broker-tee
# instead. If you must build outside CI, the GHA workflow is fully
# reproducible -- follow VERIFICATION.md Step 2.
